      "doc": "docs/concepts/SCTD-02-FIREBEETLE-P4-INTERACTIVE.md",
      "family": "sctd",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 105,
      "obj_id": "sctd:term:pending depart",
      "text": "A datamodel boolean on a seated philosopher: set true by `PHILOSOPHER_DEPART` received while not in `Thinking`; the seated philosopher completes its eat→release→think cycle, then a state-scoped transition in `Thinking` honours the depart."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "SCTD-02 (§6)",
        "term": "Host simulation control"
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/SCTD-02-FIREBEETLE-P4-INTERACTIVE.md",
      "family": "sctd",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 106,
      "obj_id": "sctd:term:host simulation control",
      "text": "A control that acts on the harness, not the machine: pause/resume (suspend the logical tick) and speed (scale logical-ms per refill). It never injects an SCXML event."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "SCTD-02 (§7)",
        "term": "Logical tick cadence"
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/SCTD-02-FIREBEETLE-P4-INTERACTIVE.md",
      "family": "sctd",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 107,
      "obj_id": "sctd:term:logical tick cadence",
      "text": "The mapping from refill iterations (~30 Hz) to machine logical-time advance, chosen so state transitions are human-watchable. Decoupled from refill rate."
